  "translation": "Na king i mas sutim ol man bilong lukautim wok long olgeta kantri bilong kingdom bilong en, na ol bai kisim ⟨את⟩ olgeta meri yangpela i nogat man yet gutpela long lukim, i go long Sushan long bikpela haus banis, i go long haus bilong ol meri, i go aninit long han bilong Hegai, saris bilong king, man i lukautim ol meri; na ol mas givim olgeta ol samting bilong klinim.",
